--!strict
--[[
	RobScript.com - Lift A Planet

	A client-side automation hub for "[WORLD 2] Lift A Planet"
	(PlaceId 93580582370636, by CoreForge Interactive).

	Features:
	  - Auto Train     keeps the Train tool equipped so the server keeps ticking strength
	  - Auto Farm      teleports to a stage, starts the lift, clicks the bar and finishes it
	  - Smart Farm     buys every booster of a stage, trains until the next stage is liftable,
	                   then farms that stage, and repeats the cycle automatically
	  - Auto Cash Out  user defined multiplier target with a panic bank fallback
	  - Auto Buy       buys Speed / Push Up Time boosters from the station pads

	Verified against the live game:
	  Training        Humanoid:EquipTool(Backpack.Train) sets LocalPlayer.Training = true
	  Lift start      fireproximityprompt(Workspace.Stages.Stage_N.Planet.LiftPrompt)
	  Lift clicks     ReplicatedStorage.Remotes.LiftClick:FireServer()  (no arguments)
	  Cash out        ReplicatedStorage.Remotes.LiftBank:FireServer()   (no arguments)
	  Multiplier      LiftUI.OverloadLabel.Text  ->  "x4.6"
	  Upgrades        fireproximityprompt(<pad>.BuyPrompt), price in <pad>.Label.StateLabel.Text

	UI: Robly Airflow (https://github.com/bobloscript/Robly_Airflow) with the
	Robscript theme from the "Robly Airflow" reference note.

	Usage: loadstring(game:HttpGet("<raw url>"))()
]]

